      "content": "1. Understanding the Role of Vocabulary in SSC Examinations"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Vocabulary mastery for SSC requires a systematic Two-Layer Strategy balancing foundational high-frequency words with advanced contextual terms.",
        "Understanding etymology through root words, prefixes, and suffixes allows candidates to decode unfamiliar vocabulary accurately under exam pressure.",
        "Tone recognition and collocation awareness serve as powerful analytical tools for elimination in cloze tests, synonyms, and antonyms.",
        "Avoiding common trap word pairs and adhering strictly to a structured revision rule ensures long-term retention and higher accuracy."
